1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:07,250
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:11,860
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:16,120
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:20,330
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,670 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:24,730
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,880
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:28,760
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,650
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,930 --> 00:00:33,320
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:35,800
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:40,560
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,569 --> 00:00:42,542
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,040
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,620
(Based on Hongshu.com's novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,650
=Episode 6=

17
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,119
I want to open a shop
in the Cold Palace.

18
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:53,759
I'll pay every bit

19
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:55,359
of the tax I owe.

20
00:00:59,799 --> 00:01:00,799
Granted.

21
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:02,200
But

22
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:04,280
on one condition.

23
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,159
Every evening at seven,

24
00:01:09,959 --> 00:01:11,120
I will personally

25
00:01:11,879 --> 00:01:12,719
check the books.

26
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:15,840
That's bedtime.

27
00:01:16,359 --> 00:01:17,680
Then go to bed later.

28
00:01:17,799 --> 00:01:18,640
The gates close.

29
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:20,519
Then we'll talk all night.

30
00:01:23,719 --> 00:01:24,799
Your Majesty.

31
00:01:26,239 --> 00:01:27,200
Consort Yao

32
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:29,159
has been kneeling outside
Shuxin Hall for quite some time.

33
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:32,400
First the Empress Dowager,

34
00:01:32,959 --> 00:01:34,239
now Consort Yao.

35
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:35,920
Farewell, Your Majesty.

36
00:01:37,959 --> 00:01:40,239
You can't wait for me to leave, can you?

37
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:41,879
Of course not.

38
00:01:45,599 --> 00:01:46,400
You two.

39
00:01:46,599 --> 00:01:47,519
From today,

40
00:01:47,719 --> 00:01:48,760
serve in the Cold Palace.

41
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:50,159
Obey

42
00:01:50,879 --> 00:01:52,799
your new lady's every command.

43
00:01:53,359 --> 00:01:54,280
- Yes, my lady.
- Yes, my lady.

44
00:01:58,760 --> 00:01:59,319
Jia?

45
00:01:59,719 --> 00:02:00,280
Yi?

46
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:03,680
Not much thought went into those names.

47
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:06,319
Your Majesty,

48
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,120
His Majesty's shadow guards

49
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:09,479
are named after the Heavenly Stems
and Earthly Branches.

50
00:02:09,719 --> 00:02:11,560
We're Jia and Yi,
the first two Heavenly Stems.

51
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,680
So you're the best?

52
00:02:15,159 --> 00:02:16,159
You could say that.

53
00:02:16,199 --> 00:02:17,400
(Jackpot!)

54
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:18,680
(These are S-rank guards.)

55
00:02:18,719 --> 00:02:20,879
(Each one must be worth ten men!)

56
00:02:21,479 --> 00:02:22,360
Jia, Yi.

57
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,719
Come up the mountain with me.

58
00:02:42,599 --> 00:02:43,479
My lady.

59
00:02:43,639 --> 00:02:45,639
What treasures are we digging for?

60
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,080
Herbs,

61
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:47,840
seeds,

62
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:50,039
and most importantly, saltpeter.

63
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:52,520
What's saltpeter?

64
00:02:53,639 --> 00:02:55,120
A treasure from nature.

65
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:56,479
It can turn water into ice.

66
00:02:56,639 --> 00:02:58,719
You can make ice too, my lady?

67
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,199
I can do

68
00:03:00,479 --> 00:03:01,599
far more than that.

69
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:03,199
Your Majesty.

70
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,240
These hills are vast.

71
00:03:05,639 --> 00:03:07,120
Finding one particular kind of stone

72
00:03:07,319 --> 00:03:08,319
won't be easy.

73
00:03:08,919 --> 00:03:09,879
Are there

74
00:03:10,599 --> 00:03:11,680
any salt lakes nearby?

75
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:12,520
None that I know of.

76
00:03:13,199 --> 00:03:14,400
What about privies

77
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:15,879
or cesspits?

78
00:03:15,879 --> 00:03:17,319
By the Imperial Stables
at the foot of the mountain,

79
00:03:17,319 --> 00:03:18,879
there's an abandoned cesspit.

80
00:03:19,159 --> 00:03:19,919
Perfect!

81
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:20,639
Take me there.

82
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:21,759
Your Majesty,

83
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,520
you're not going to

84
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:25,280
dig through dung, are you?

85
00:03:27,439 --> 00:03:29,039
Saltpeter forms in places like that.

86
00:03:29,039 --> 00:03:30,840
It's the fastest way to collect it.

87
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:32,800
It's science. Got it?

88
00:03:33,159 --> 00:03:34,680
I don't know what science is.

89
00:03:34,759 --> 00:03:36,319
But you're far too noble

90
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:37,680
to do such a thing!

91
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:39,319
When starting a business,

92
00:03:39,479 --> 00:03:40,639
I can't be too fussy.

93
00:03:41,159 --> 00:03:41,599
Come on.

94
00:03:41,759 --> 00:03:43,400
Let's go make our fortunes!

95
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:46,199
Brother.

96
00:03:46,439 --> 00:03:48,439
These hands have slain enemy soldiers,

97
00:03:48,439 --> 00:03:49,599
and now we're going to shovel dung?

98
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:53,840
His Majesty said

99
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:55,599
to obey our new lady.

100
00:03:56,599 --> 00:03:57,240
Let's go.

101
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:03,599
(His Majesty arrives!)

102
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:11,560
Your Majesty.

103
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:12,960
You're finally here.

104
00:04:13,479 --> 00:04:14,759
Your Highness,

105
00:04:14,759 --> 00:04:16,160
why are you so pale?

106
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:19,319
I've been kneeling for so long.

107
00:04:19,519 --> 00:04:20,920
I feel weak.

108
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:22,199
My legs...

109
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:24,519
I fear I can't stand.

110
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:28,279
Rise.

111
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:45,199
Careful, Your Highness. It's slippery.

112
00:04:48,519 --> 00:04:50,000
If your legs are weak,

113
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,319
go back and rest.

114
00:04:51,759 --> 00:04:54,120
Why paint your face like a ghost
and come out here scaring people?

115
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:55,480
Your Majesty.

116
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:57,800
My father sent a confidential
report from the border.

117
00:04:57,920 --> 00:05:00,000
He told me to give it to you in person.

118
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:00,800
The envoy...

119
00:05:01,199 --> 00:05:03,439
He's waiting at Lixia Palace.

120
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:05,360
We're going to Lixia Palace.

121
00:05:05,439 --> 00:05:06,160
Yes, Your Majesty.

122
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:09,879
(Aunt.)

123
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:12,319
(I won't disappoint you this time.)

124
00:05:12,503 --> 00:05:14,150
(Lixia Palace)

125
00:05:17,267 --> 00:05:18,120
(Three northern prefectures
have suffered years of drought.)

126
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:20,639
(Grain prices soar.)
The rich hoard grain to raise prices!

127
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:23,000
The poor trade children to eat.

128
00:05:24,079 --> 00:05:25,959
How dare they exploit this disaster

129
00:05:26,319 --> 00:05:27,639
to gain profit!

130
00:05:31,056 --> 00:05:32,516
(The rich hoard grain;
the poor trade children to eat.)

131
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:35,720
Tell your general

132
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:36,879
I've received his report.

133
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,319
Yes, Your Majesty.

134
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:47,600
This is a specialty from
the southern borderlands.

135
00:05:47,879 --> 00:05:49,000
Passion Incense.

136
00:05:50,079 --> 00:05:51,040
With this,

137
00:05:51,439 --> 00:05:53,120
His Majesty won't be able to resist you.

138
00:05:53,839 --> 00:05:55,600
Aunt, how did you get this
from the southern borderlands?

139
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:58,000
That is none of your concern.

140
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:03,240
Focus on pleasing His Majesty

141
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:05,399
and bearing an heir soon.

142
00:06:05,959 --> 00:06:06,959
Yes, Aunt.

143
00:06:09,319 --> 00:06:10,439
Please calm down, Your Majesty.

144
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:12,199
It's time for dinner.

145
00:06:12,199 --> 00:06:15,040
I've had your favorite dishes prepared.

146
00:06:15,439 --> 00:06:16,279
I'm not hungry.

147
00:06:19,279 --> 00:06:21,680
We actually found saltpeter deposits!

148
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:22,680
Heh-heh.

149
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:26,319
Luo's Ice Shop is about to open!

150
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:29,480
It's filthy!

151
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:30,279
My lady.

152
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:31,319
Wipe your hands.

153
00:06:31,879 --> 00:06:32,720
What's the fuss?

154
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:34,160
It didn't come from inside the cesspit.

155
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:37,000
This stuff is a treasure.

156
00:06:37,639 --> 00:06:38,399
Your Majesty.

157
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:40,959
Can these stones really make ice?

158
00:06:41,399 --> 00:06:43,279
Could you show us?

159
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:47,720
This will be your job from now on.

160
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:49,160
I'll only show you once.

161
00:06:49,160 --> 00:06:50,079
Watch closely.

162
00:06:58,639 --> 00:07:00,360
Spirits of earth and sky,

163
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:02,079
science, show us why!

164
00:07:02,079 --> 00:07:02,879
By my command,

165
00:07:02,879 --> 00:07:03,639
freeze!

166
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,639
It really froze!

167
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:14,439
It...

168
00:07:14,439 --> 00:07:15,480
It actually froze!

169
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:20,839
It's ice!

170
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:23,959
You're amazing, my lady!

171
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:25,639
It worked on the first try!

172
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:27,639
Child's play.

173
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:28,879
Your Majesty.

174
00:07:28,879 --> 00:07:30,680
May I tell His Majesty about this?

175
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:31,720
Go ahead.

176
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:32,959
As long as he keeps it to himself.

177
00:07:32,959 --> 00:07:34,079
Don't ruin my business.

178
00:07:34,439 --> 00:07:34,920
Yes.

179
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:36,600
All right.

180
00:07:36,839 --> 00:07:37,959
You've worked hard all day.

181
00:07:37,959 --> 00:07:38,839
Go and rest.

182
00:07:39,439 --> 00:07:40,120
Yinshuang.

183
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:41,759
Prepare my bath.

184
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:42,759
Yes, my lady.

185
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,240
This mutton

186
00:07:45,439 --> 00:07:47,199
is especially good
for restoring vitality.

187
00:07:47,439 --> 00:07:50,800
I had it stewed with deer antler
for six hours.

188
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:02,600
Something's wrong.

189
00:08:05,079 --> 00:08:06,720
I've only had two cups.

190
00:08:07,879 --> 00:08:08,680
Why...

191
00:08:10,279 --> 00:08:11,240
Your Majesty.

192
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:13,639
Maybe it's not the wine
that's making you drunk.

193
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:16,279
Have a few more cups.

194
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:28,120
Come here.

195
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:37,399
Your Majesty.

196
00:08:37,919 --> 00:08:41,200
You've finally noticed me.

197
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:54,200
You drugged my food?

198
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:55,120
I...

199
00:08:55,279 --> 00:08:56,639
I wouldn't dare!

200
00:08:56,759 --> 00:08:58,399
I ate it too.

201
00:08:58,720 --> 00:08:59,840
Your Majesty,

202
00:09:00,759 --> 00:09:02,600
you must've been pent up for too long.

203
00:09:19,039 --> 00:09:21,000
Your Majesty!

204
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:23,600
Cao Zhongquan!

205
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,080
Your Majesty.

206
00:09:25,799 --> 00:09:26,480
Your Majesty!

207
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,120
From this day,

208
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:30,320
Consort Yao is confined.

209
00:09:31,159 --> 00:09:32,639
She may not leave without my decree.

210
00:09:33,039 --> 00:09:34,000
Your Majesty!

211
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,840
I'm innocent, Your Majesty!

212
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:38,080
I only wanted you to notice me!

213
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:39,360
I'll summon the imperial physician.

214
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:39,919
Your Majesty!

215
00:09:39,919 --> 00:09:40,759
The Cold Palace.

216
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:42,360
Now.

217
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:44,679
I want to see Lu Yunluo.

218
00:09:44,919 --> 00:09:45,559
Yes, Your Majesty.

219
00:09:47,519 --> 00:09:49,200
Your Majesty!

220
00:09:57,679 --> 00:09:59,759
The Empress in the Cold Palace,

221
00:10:01,559 --> 00:10:03,919
Lu Yunluo?

222
00:10:08,476 --> 00:10:10,183
(Cold Palace)

223
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:10,639
Quickly!

224
00:10:10,919 --> 00:10:12,480
Tell your lady to come out!

225
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:14,960
Greetings, Your Majesty.

226
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:17,279
My lady is bathing.

227
00:10:18,443 --> 00:10:19,743
(Cold Palace)

228
00:10:19,759 --> 00:10:21,320
Your Majesty, you can't go in!

229
00:10:21,879 --> 00:10:22,960
Insolent servant!

230
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,159
You dare block His Majesty?

231
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,320
Have you a death wish?

232
00:10:27,219 --> 00:10:28,526
(Cold Palace)

233
00:10:28,559 --> 00:10:30,279
My lady's chastity...

234
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:32,799
Your lady's chastity matters,

235
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:35,080
but His Majesty's doesn't?

236
00:10:35,159 --> 00:10:37,240
My lady has never been with a man!

237
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:39,679
His Majesty is still a virgin too!

238
00:10:55,639 --> 00:10:56,440
Ji Wujue!

239
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:57,919
Are you mad?

240
00:10:58,559 --> 00:10:59,679
How did you get in?

241
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:01,360
Yinshuang!

242
00:11:01,399 --> 00:11:03,159
Brother, Her Majesty is
calling for help.

243
00:11:04,799 --> 00:11:05,879
Pretend you didn't hear.

244
00:11:05,879 --> 00:11:06,480
Got it.

245
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:08,600
Lu Yunluo.

246
00:11:12,240 --> 00:11:13,120
Is it really you?

247
00:11:16,679 --> 00:11:17,759
What's wrong with you?

248
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:19,320
Are you possessed?

249
00:11:20,919 --> 00:11:22,080
Just now,

250
00:11:23,279 --> 00:11:25,279
I nearly mistook Consort Yao for you.

251
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:29,159
You've been drugged.

252
00:11:31,279 --> 00:11:32,159
Don't worry.

253
00:11:33,240 --> 00:11:34,399
I'll only stay a moment.

254
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:37,159
I won't force myself on you.

255
00:11:47,039 --> 00:11:47,840
Come here.

256
00:11:48,759 --> 00:11:49,399
I'll help you.

257
00:12:15,190 --> 00:12:19,220
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

258
00:12:19,610 --> 00:12:23,830
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

259
00:12:23,870 --> 00:12:28,050
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

260
00:12:28,110 --> 00:12:32,300
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

261
00:12:32,640 --> 00:12:36,700
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

262
00:12:36,770 --> 00:12:40,950
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

263
00:12:41,390 --> 00:12:44,760
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

264
00:12:45,230 --> 00:12:49,910
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

265
00:12:51,570 --> 00:12:53,720
♪No finery to rival spring♪

266
00:12:53,900 --> 00:12:58,200
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

267
00:13:00,610 --> 00:13:02,360
♪Where is beauty found?♪

268
00:13:02,540 --> 00:13:06,970
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

269
00:13:07,530 --> 00:13:09,100
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

270
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:11,590
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

271
00:13:11,660 --> 00:13:13,740
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

272
00:13:13,900 --> 00:13:15,670
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

273
00:13:16,280 --> 00:13:17,550
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

274
00:13:17,780 --> 00:13:20,180
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

275
00:13:20,420 --> 00:13:22,720
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

276
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:27,320
♪Come, share a cup with me♪
